_of_Rock_Cropped.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg/500px-Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg/1280px-Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg/500px-Blue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Civil twilight in a small town in the Mojave Desert","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABlue_hour_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_California_2017.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Twilight_Toronto_across_Lake_Ontario51km_with_ship5-10km.jpg/500px-Twilight_Toronto_across_Lake_Ontario51km_with_ship5-10km.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Twilight_Toronto_across_Lake_Ontario51km_with_ship5-10km.jpg/1280px-Twilight_Toronto_across_Lake_Ontario51km_with_ship5-10km.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Twilight_Toronto_across_Lake_Ontario51km_with_ship5-10km.jpg/500px-Twilight_Toronto_across_Lake_Ontario51km_with_ship5-10km.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Evening nautical twilight on Lake Ontario, Canada","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATwilight_Toronto_across_Lake_Ontario51km_with_ship5-10km.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wiki